# InvestOrch Agent Memory

This file indexes durable user and project facts, preferences, decisions, and relevant history.

- Keep this file concise; index focused topic files when needed.
- Read only memory relevant to the current task.
- Verify relevant claims against current evidence and resolve conflicting decisions with the user.
- Update the existing topic with its current fact, scope and supporting artifact; replace superseded guidance.
- Never store secrets or credentials.
- Runtime state, raw tool output, todos, and full transcripts are not long-term memory.
- Reusable professional workflows belong in Skills, not Memory.
- Keep detailed research results in their verified reports and link them from the relevant topic.
